  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7be775904db28fe4a999c7896671bd83, type: 3}
  m_Name: DJ^2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterText: Despite how loud the music was, the DJ booth was surprisingly calm.
    As you approach, he puts his hands on his computer. "Oh hey there lil' one!"
    He says with a voice that almost blends into the music. "You got anything for
    me?"
  encounterSprite: {fileID: 3484184639304537256, guid: 3d7f417aed9ac54438377ebe7281112d, type: 3}
  nextQuestion: {fileID: 0}
  responses:
  - You eagerly give him your request, yelling at a volume that chalenges the music
    itself. He smiles and starts pulling up options on his machine. "Alright! Got
    it queued!"
  - You try to open your mouth again and again, but what's the point? You can't hear
    him, he probably can't hear you, and they aren't going to have the song anyways.
  - What follows is you two trying to yell over the music, frustrated that he wouldn't
    turn it down. He kept mishearing you <b>again and again!</b> Luckily, you get
    your song queued up.
  - You ask if they have your request, knowing full well it's rarely included in
    these machines. Takes a while, <i>but they do have it.</i> You smile as you walk
    away, knowing there is something to look forward to.
  punishment: 02000000030000000400000002000000
  scaryMode: 0
  isABoss: 0
